      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "content": "<p>A complete elemental affinity chart for the standard enemies of Expedition 33. Use it to check what a given enemy is weak to, what it resists, and whether anything is <strong>absorbed</strong> - absorbing an element means your attack heals it, which is the single most common way to lose a fight you should have won.</p>"
